{"seq":3,"slug":"on-contradiction","title":"《矛盾论》精读","stage":"DONE","category":"mao-zedong-studies","categoryLabel":"毛泽东研究","chapterCount":4,"docCount":11,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-contradiction","rating":{"composite":3.82,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.33,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.1,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/01_mao-zedong-studies/03_on-contradiction","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"矛盾论-精读-简介\">《矛盾论》精读 简介</h1><p>《矛盾论》是毛泽东于一九三七年八月在延安抗日军政大学讲授哲学课时所写的重要著作，与《实践论》并列为毛泽东哲学思想的两大经典文本。全文以唯物辩证法的对立统一规律为核心，系统阐述了矛盾的普遍性与特殊性、主要矛盾与矛盾的主要方面、矛盾的同一性与斗争性等根本范畴，构建了一套完整的矛盾分析方法论体系。</p>\n<p>本知识库适用于希望深入理解唯物辩证法核心原理的读者，无论是马克思主义哲学研究者、政治理论学习者，还是对辩证思维方法感兴趣的一般读者，都能通过本书的精读获得严密的哲学思维训练。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>哲学基础与写作背景</strong>，从两种宇宙观的根本对立出发，阐明唯物辩证法与形而上学的本质分歧，还原毛泽东撰写此文时反对党内教条主义的历史语境，并追溯辩证法从古代到马克思主义的思想发展脉络。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>矛盾的普遍性与特殊性</strong>，深入解析矛盾存在于一切事物发展过程中的普遍性原理，论述不同事物、不同发展阶段矛盾各有其特殊性质的具体分析方法，并阐释普遍性与特殊性之间相互联结、相互转化的辩证关系。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>主要矛盾与矛盾的主要方面</strong>，分析复杂事物中诸多矛盾的不平衡性，阐明主要矛盾与次要矛盾的区分原则及其相互转化规律，进而深入论述矛盾双方中主要方面与次要方面的辩证关系及其对事物性质的决定作用。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>矛盾的同一性与斗争性及当代应用</strong>，系统阐述矛盾双方既对立又统一的辩证关系，分析对抗性矛盾与非对抗性矛盾的区分及其在不同条件下的转化规律，并探讨矛盾分析法在当代社会分析与实践中的应用价值。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径为：先通过第一章建立哲学视野与历史感知，理解《矛盾论》的理论渊源与写作目的；再依次深入第二章和第三章，掌握矛盾分析法的核心工具；最后在第四章中完成对矛盾辩证运动全貌的把握，并将理论与当代实践相联结。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"philosophical-foundation","title":"哲学基础与写作背景","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-contradiction/philosophical-foundation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"two-worldviews-opposition","title":"两种宇宙观的对立","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-contradiction/philosophical-foundation/two-worldviews-opposition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"anti-dogmatism-context","title":"写作背景：反对教条主义","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-contradiction/philosophical-foundation/anti-dogmatism-context"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dialectics-development-history","title":"辩证法发展史","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-contradiction/philosophical-foundation/dialectics-development-history"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"universality-particularity","title":"矛盾的普遍性与特殊性","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-contradiction/universality-particularity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"universality-of-contradiction","title":"矛盾普遍性原理","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-contradiction/universality-particularity/universality-of-contradiction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"particularity-of-contradiction","title":"矛盾特殊性原理","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-contradiction/universality-particularity/particularity-of-contradiction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"universal-particular-dialectics","title":"普遍性与特殊性的辩证关系","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-contradiction/universality-particularity/universal-particular-dialectics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"principal-contradiction","title":"主要矛盾与矛盾的主要方面","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-contradiction/principal-contradiction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"principal-secondary-contradiction","title":"主要矛盾与次要矛盾","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-contradiction/principal-contradiction/principal-secondary-contradiction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"principal-aspect-of-contradiction","title":"矛盾的主要方面与次要方面","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-contradiction/principal-contradiction/principal-aspect-of-contradiction"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"identity-struggle-application","title":"矛盾的同一性与斗争性及当代应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-contradiction/identity-struggle-application","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"identity-and-struggle","title":"矛盾的同一性与斗争性","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-contradiction/identity-struggle-application/identity-and-struggle"},{"seq":2,"slug":"antagonism-in-contradiction","title":"对抗在矛盾中的地位","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-contradiction/identity-struggle-application/antagonism-in-contradiction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contemporary-application","title":"矛盾分析法的当代应用","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-contradiction/identity-struggle-application/contemporary-application"}]}]}